# 8 MB flash override, layered AFTER sdkconfig.gaggimate.defaults.
#
# The display-class defaults pin 16 MB for the LilyGo T-RGB. display-headless-8m
# builds the same firmware for a seeed_xiao_esp32s3 (8 MB) with
# partitions/default_8mb.csv, so it appends this file to bring the size back
# down. Order matters: SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS is applied left to right and the last
# assignment wins, so this must come after sdkconfig.gaggimate.defaults.
#
# Why it is pinned at all rather than taken from board.json: see the note in
# sdkconfig.gaggimate.defaults. PlatformIO only warns about a mismatch.
#
# Only the =y entry is given. FLASHSIZE_* is a Kconfig choice, and kconfgen
# resolves a choice from the last member set to y across the merged defaults --
# an explicit `CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_16MB=n` is not needed and would just
# be a redundant line to keep in sync.
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_8MB=y
CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE="8MB"
